WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:14.789
Whoosh! Roxy zoomed over Metro City.

2
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:20.583
"I have to stop those pirates," she thought.

3
00:00:20.584 --> 00:00:23.104
She spotted The Wharf and saw people outside.

4
00:00:23.105 --> 00:00:24.754
They looked scared.

5
00:00:24.755 --> 00:00:28.292
A loud crash came from inside the restaurant.

6
00:00:28.293 --> 00:00:32.835
Then Roxy heard laughter.

7
00:00:32.836 --> 00:00:36.967
Roxy rushed in.

8
00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:39.853
Food and broken plates covered the floor.

9
00:00:39.854 --> 00:00:43.070
People were hiding behind chairs and under tables.

10
00:00:43.071 --> 00:00:46.474
"This is terrible!" a woman cried.

11
00:00:46.475 --> 00:00:49.698
"I should have eaten at home!"

12
00:00:49.699 --> 00:00:54.415
Mean-looking pirates stood around one long table, shouting and laughing.

13
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:56.783
A waiter stood on the table.

14
00:00:56.784 --> 00:01:00.976
He shook with fear as the pirates pointed swords at him.

15
00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:05.250
"You're going to walk the plank!" one pirate shouted.

16
00:01:05.251 --> 00:01:07.386
A parrot sat on her shoulder.

17
00:01:07.387 --> 00:01:09.781
"The plank!" the parrot said.

18
00:01:09.782 --> 00:01:11.254
The waiter bit his lip.

19
00:01:11.255 --> 00:01:14.371
"I wish Rocket Girl was here!"

20
00:01:14.372 --> 00:01:17.277
"Who's Rocket Girl?" the pirate asked.

21
00:01:17.278 --> 00:01:20.444
"Who's Rocket Girl?" the parrot said.

22
00:01:20.445 --> 00:01:22.540
"I am!" Roxy said.

23
00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:26.664
"And I'm putting a stop to this right now!"

24
00:01:26.665 --> 00:01:29.038
The pirates spun around.

25
00:01:29.039 --> 00:01:33.057
"Whew!" the waiter said. "Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

26
00:01:33.058 --> 00:01:35.063
Roxy glared at the pirates.

27
00:01:35.064 --> 00:01:38.711
"This is not how you behave in a restaurant!"

28
00:01:38.712 --> 00:01:43.424
"My name is Bonnie Bones," the pirate with the parrot said.

29
00:01:43.425 --> 00:01:47.260
"We're pirates, and we behave any way we like.

30
00:01:47.261 --> 00:01:52.147
We rob banks and we cause trouble!" She kicked a chair.

31
00:01:52.148 --> 00:01:55.015
"Yo-ho-ho!" the parrot said.

32
00:01:55.016 --> 00:01:58.231
"You're all under arrest," Roxy said.

33
00:01:58.232 --> 00:02:02.739
Bonnie Bones pointed her hook at Roxy. "Get her, men!"

34
00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:07.249
"Arr!" The pirates charged toward Roxy, waving their swords.

35
00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:11.248
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

36
00:02:11.249 --> 00:02:14.636
One pirate's sword exploded.

37
00:02:14.637 --> 00:02:17.774
Roxy ducked as another pirate swung his sword at her.

38
00:02:17.775 --> 00:02:20.191
The sword split a table in half.

39
00:02:20.192 --> 00:02:22.591
The third pirate stepped closer.

40
00:02:22.592 --> 00:02:27.404
The tip of his sword brushed Roxy's nose.

41
00:02:27.405 --> 00:02:35.071
"Now you're in trouble!" He laughed. "I'll—"

42
00:02:35.072 --> 00:02:38.242
Just then police officers rushed into the restaurant.

43
00:02:38.243 --> 00:02:41.628
Three pirates froze.

44
00:02:41.629 --> 00:02:45.419
But Bonnie Bones ran for the door.

45
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:48.254
Roxy shot after her.

46
00:02:48.255 --> 00:02:51.093
"Arr!" Bonnie Bones shouted.

47
00:02:51.094 --> 00:02:56.863
"You'll never catch me, Rocket Girl!"

48
00:02:56.864 --> 00:03:01.516
She climbed into a big pirate ship in the parking lot.

49
00:03:01.517 --> 00:03:06.132
Rumble, rumble! The ship lifted off the ground and flew away.

50
00:03:06.133 --> 00:03:11.268
"Stop!" Roxy flew after the ship.

51
00:03:11.269 --> 00:03:14.898
Creak! A hatch on the side of the ship opened.

52
00:03:14.899 --> 00:03:17.731
Roxy saw something inside.

53
00:03:17.732 --> 00:03:20.386
The thing was shiny, with sharp teeth.

54
00:03:20.387 --> 00:03:26.306
Its jaws snapped open and shut as it flew out of the ship.

55
00:03:26.307 --> 00:03:30.652
Chomp! Chomp! It snapped at Roxy.

56
00:03:30.653 --> 00:03:34.520
"A flying robot shark!" Roxy cried.

57
00:03:34.521 --> 00:03:40.313
Bonnie Bones laughed. "Good-bye, Rocket Girl!"

58
00:03:40.314 --> 00:03:48.358
The parrot laughed. "Good-bye, Rocket Girl!"
